{'symbol': 'TMO', 'date': '2021-10-01 06:00:00', 'title': 'THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC OPENS BIOLOGICS MANUFACTURING SITE IN LENGNAU, SWITZERLAND', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS., OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THERMO FISHER SCIENTIFIC INC. (NYSE:TMO), THE WORLD LEADER IN SERVING SCIENCE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ASSUMED OPERATIONAL RESPONSIBILITY FOR A NEW BIOLOGICS MANUFACTURING SITE IN LENGNAU, SWITZERLAND AS PART OF ITS STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH CSL LIMITED ANNOUNCED\xa0LAST YEAR.'}